---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-surface">
	<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6">
		<div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]">
			<div class="max-w-sm">
				<a
					href="/"
					class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent"
					aria-label={`${site.name}, ir al inicio`}
				>
					<Logo class="size-8 text-accent" />
					<span class="title-3">{site.name}</span>
				</a>
				<p class="body-6 mt-4 text-ink-soft">{site.description}</p>

				<ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<Icon name="pin" class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-accent" />
						<span class="caption-1 text-ink-soft">
							{site.address}<br />{site.addressCity}
						</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<Icon name="clock" class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-accent" />
						<span class="caption-1 text-ink-soft">{site.hours}</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="title-4 text-ink">Áreas de práctica</h2>
				<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3">
					<li>
						<a href="/#accidentes" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Accidentes de tránsito
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/#familia" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Derecho de familia
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/#preguntas" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Preguntas frecuentes
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="title-4 text-ink">El bufete</h2>
				<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3">
					<li>
						<a href="/#bufete" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Quiénes somos
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/#consulta" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Solicitar consulta
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href={`tel:${site.phone}`} class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							{site.phoneDisplay}
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							{site.email}
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="title-4 text-ink">Legal</h2>
				<ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3">
					<li>
						<a href="/aviso-legal" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Aviso legal
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/privacidad" class="caption-1 text-ink-soft transition duration-300 ease-base hover:text-accent">
							Política de privacidad
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6">
			<p class="caption-2 text-ink-soft">
				Los contenidos de este sitio son informativos y no constituyen asesoramiento legal para un
				caso concreto. Los resultados de casos anteriores no garantizan resultados similares.
			</p>
			<p class="caption-5 text-ink-soft">
				© {year} {site.name}. Todos los derechos reservados.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
